From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: smit1237 <smit1237@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:47:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 15/30] buildroot: RNSBox defconfig and package wiring

Set the hostname to rnsbox; strip audio and unused python modules; enable
python3 + flask + pyserial + cryptography, the new in-tree packages
(python-rns, python-lxmf, python-nomadnet, rnsbox-portal), nano, dosfstools
and the WiFi userspace; build the Rust host toolchain from source; and size
the rootfs for the clients disc. Wire the four RNSBox packages into
package/Config.in. Placed last so every referenced package directory exists.
---
